                                                "example_id": "17be46a9-0e37-46c3-8875-3c0302816fd9",
                                                "sense_id": "0b79fd27-e34f-3d77-81eb-bcf0f4f81fe6",
                                                "text": "2004, Umberto Eco (Geoffrey Brock. trans.), The Mysterious Flame of Queen Loana, →ISBN, p. 120,\nIf a cellar prefigures the underworld, an attic promises a rather threadbare paradise, where the dead bodies appear in a pulverulent glow."
                                            }
